{# Design note (template comment — omitted from the rendered LLM prompt).

   Contract: MultiBlank similarity_score / error_category are assigned in grading code.

   DOK × Bloom mapping:
   - Persistence and adaptive selection use dok_level ∈ {1,2,3,4} (Webb DOK).
     The UI may surface this as "Difficulty Level".
   - Bloom's six process levels are collapsed onto those four bands for generation:
       DOK 1 = Remember + Understand
       DOK 2 = Apply + light Analyze
       DOK 3 = deeper Analyze + Evaluate
       DOK 4 = Evaluate + Create (constrained to excerpt-grounded synthesis)
   - Generation receives dok_level and bloom_focus; runtime DDA uses dok_level only.
